<!doctype lake><title>无标题文档</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h2 data-lake-id="I0g4j" id="I0g4j" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="uba1ab329" id="uba1ab329">🌊</span><span data-lake-id="uf35b95fc" id="uf35b95fc"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u00d313e1" id="u00d313e1">𝐐𝐰𝐞𝐧 𝐒𝐩𝐚𝐫𝐬𝐞 𝐀𝐭𝐭𝐞𝐧𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧</span></strong></h2><p data-lake-id="u403e3b05" id="u403e3b05"><strong><span data-lake-id="ubae6ae02" id="ubae6ae02">稀疏注意力通过选择性地关注重要上下文，缓解长上下文场景中 softmax 注意力的二次计算复杂度瓶颈。近期，DSA 利用轻量级索引器生成词元级稀疏掩码，实现显著的推理加速。然而，随着序列长度增加，其复杂度为</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O(n%5E2)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff2d5f588234eb61a559ff90c41511b85.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WzZvP%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u87d38b09" id="u87d38b09">的索引器仍会带来不可忽略的开销</span></strong></p><ul list="udfc58f88"><li fid="u532e7a6b" data-lake-id="u97bcb91e" id="u97bcb91e"><span data-lake-id="u2d27c2c3" id="u2d27c2c3">为降低这一索引成本，Qwen3.8-Flash-Next 采用 Qwen 稀疏注意力。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u010d3214" id="u010d3214" style="color: #DF2A3F">具体而言，QSA 使用轻量级索引器，将序列压缩为微块表示，估计各微块的重要性，并选择最相关的上下文参与注意力计算。这一设计降低长输入下的索引开销，同时兼顾任务表现与推理效率。相较于跨层共享索引的方法，QSA 在层内进行序列压缩，对跨层相似性的依赖较低，因此天然适用于混合架构</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u4949c012" id="u4949c012">​</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uce8fa9d3" id="uce8fa9d3" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1793494874762-45658862-9a80-418b-9c7a-e8fa82e0bec5.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22uf9fa44cc-94ce-4067-a411-c053dbcf6c7%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u68e21100-103f-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A722.7999877929688%2C%22height%22%3A375%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A109383%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1156%2C%22originHeight%22%3A599%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22COMPRESSEDLIGHTWEIGHTINDEXER%22%2C%22x%22%3A103%2C%22y%22%3A160%2C%22width%22%3A273%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SPARSECOREATTENTION%22%2C%22x%22%3A656%2C%22y%22%3A159%2C%22width%22%3A188%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MICRO-BLOCKSPARSEATTENTIONMASK%22%2C%22x%22%3A682%2C%22y%22%3A447%2C%22width%22%3A292%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22COMPRESSEDATTENTIONMASK%22%2C%22x%22%3A106%2C%22y%22%3A445%2C%22width%22%3A252%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TOPKINDICES%22%2C%22x%22%3A324%2C%22y%22%3A55%2C%22width%22%3A122%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TOP-KSELECTO%22%2C%22x%22%3A180%2C%22y%22%3A76%2C%22width%22%3A113%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ZERO-CENTERE%22%2C%22x%22%3A704%2C%22y%22%3A277%2C%22width%22%3A83%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%89%93%E4%B8%AD%E6%89%93%E8%8D%89%E7%9B%B4%E6%89%93%E7%9B%B4%E8%8D%89%E7%9B%B4%E7%9B%B4%E7%9B%B4%22%2C%22x%22%3A677%2C%22y%22%3A407%2C%22width%22%3A213%2C%22height%22%3A10%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PARTIALROPE%22%2C%22x%22%3A71%2C%22y%22%3A232%2C%22width%22%3A78%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ZERO-CENTERE%22%2C%22x%22%3A556%2C%22y%22%3A277%2C%22width%22%3A80%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ZERO-CENTERE%22%2C%22x%22%3A72%2C%22y%22%3A277%2C%22width%22%3A77%2C%22height%22%3A10%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PARTIALROPE%22%2C%22x%22%3A563%2C%22y%22%3A232%2C%22width%22%3A72%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RMSNORM%22%2C%22x%22%3A706%2C%22y%22%3A292%2C%22width%22%3A75%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ERO-CENTERED%22%2C%22x%22%3A328%2C%22y%22%3A269%2C%22width%22%3A78%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ARTIALROPE%22%2C%22x%22%3A719%2C%22y%22%3A232%2C%22width%22%3A63%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LINEAR%22%2C%22x%22%3A721%2C%22y%22%3A60%2C%22width%22%3A60%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RMSNOM%22%2C%22x%22%3A329%2C%22y%22%3A284%2C%22width%22%3A67%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RMSNOM%22%2C%22x%22%3A558%2C%22y%22%3A292%2C%22width%22%3A75%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SIGMOID%22%2C%22x%22%3A1035%2C%22y%22%3A60%2C%22width%22%3A69%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RMSNOM%22%2C%22x%22%3A75%2C%22y%22%3A292%2C%22width%22%3A72%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LINEAL%22%2C%22x%22%3A714%2C%22y%22%3A339%2C%22width%22%3A59%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LINEA%22%2C%22x%22%3A870%2C%22y%22%3A339%2C%22width%22%3A52%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LINEAR%22%2C%22x%22%3A570%2C%22y%22%3A339%2C%22width%22%3A55%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22K%E4%B8%AA%22%2C%22x%22%3A707%2C%22y%22%3A205%2C%22width%22%3A70%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LINEAR%22%2C%22x%22%3A79%2C%22y%22%3A339%2C%22width%22%3A64%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22AVGPOOL%22%2C%22x%22%3A332%2C%22y%22%3A320%2C%22width%22%3A60%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%89%93%E4%B8%AD%E6%89%93%E6%89%93%E4%B8%AD%E7%9B%B4%E4%B8%8A%E7%9B%B4%E7%9B%B4%E7%9B%B4%E9%87%8D%E4%B8%AD%E9%87%8D%E8%8D%89%E9%87%8D%E7%9B%B4%E7%9B%B4%E7%9B%B4%22%2C%22x%22%3A861%2C%22y%22%3A406%2C%22width%22%3A200%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LINEAR%22%2C%22x%22%3A1014%2C%22y%22%3A338%2C%22width%22%3A68%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LINEAR%22%2C%22x%22%3A336%2C%22y%22%3A360%2C%22width%22%3A55%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%9A%E6%89%93%E4%B8%8A%22%2C%22x%22%3A48%2C%22y%22%3A406%2C%22width%22%3A182%2C%22height%22%3A10%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RTIALROP%22%2C%22x%22%3A338%2C%22y%22%3A233%2C%22width%22%3A52%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2244444747404071777007000770%22%2C%22x%22%3A91%2C%22y%22%3A431%2C%22width%22%3A240%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A738%2C%22y%22%3A100%2C%22width%22%3A25%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23edecea%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u6df4c96f%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u52c9e1ca" id="u52c9e1ca"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub4e3f797" id="ub4e3f797">压缩式轻量级索引器：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ua3cbea32" id="ua3cbea32">给定输入隐状态</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffacb4d282568f25626d22799a25b3896.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iCKS2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufa6dd749" id="ufa6dd749">，索引器采用包含</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22H%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fff1b78684db901dd0b7bfa173991deab.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xeoOG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uef419d85" id="uef419d85">个查询头和一个共享键头的多查询注意力。首先，分别执行独立的轻量级投影</span></p><p data-lake-id="uf3b40414" id="uf3b40414" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cwidehat%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D%7D_i%5E%7Bh%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BRMSNorm%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_Q%5E%7Bh%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_i%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_i%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_K%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_i%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B12%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd26c7395ec872820715fc891cbb84c93.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22X4MQD%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uab3677c5"><li fid="u27256e1c" data-lake-id="u071a2bb1" id="u071a2bb1"><span data-lake-id="u5fca68a2" id="u5fca68a2">为缩短序列长度，将键划分为互不重叠的块，每个块包含</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F72cb3a229067770aeb6caa625a65a1a1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jMbpb%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2efc66a4" id="u2efc66a4">个词元，并通过平均池化进行压缩。记第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22b%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd29c2e5f4926e5b0e9a95305650f6e54.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DR2Lq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4976a1b8" id="u4976a1b8">个块的起始位置为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_b%3Db%5C%5Ccdot%20r%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb5827695cc8a2f14b90a8d87c8d6a9ef.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eX77R%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u845773bb" id="u845773bb">，则相应的压缩键为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u4aaa0c3f" id="u4aaa0c3f" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cwidehat%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D%7D_b%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BRMSNorm%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BAvgPool%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_%7Bp_b%3Ap_b%2Br-1%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%5Cn0%5C%5Cleq%20b%3C%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%5C%5Clfloor%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7Bn%7D%7Br%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright%5C%5Crfloor%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B13%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc9646b54491355530e5064a1bb0d7bc6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22U1j1Z%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u91287038"><li fid="ua34f7d6d" data-lake-id="ud82999aa" id="ud82999aa"><span data-lake-id="u6a2637f7" id="u6a2637f7">在位置编码方面，索引器采用部分旋转位置嵌入。具体而言，在索引器每个头的 128 个维度中，仅对其中 64 个维度应用 RoPE，其旋转维度与核心注意力模块保持一致。键压缩先于位置编码执行。因此，每个块先被汇总为一个内容表示，再被赋予一个块级位置。这一顺序避免对具有不同旋转相位的词元表示进行平均。每个查询保留自身的词元位置 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2443fbcfeb7e85e1d62b6f5e4f27207e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SMqVE%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9520f5ca" id="u9520f5ca">，每个压缩键则使用所属块的起始位置 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_b%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3eda1156a1c5288564e08418f4d55ce0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xWbBb%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue0ca769a" id="ue0ca769a">​</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uea22fbf4" id="uea22fbf4" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_i%5E%7Bh%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BPRoPE%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Cwidehat%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D%7D_i%5E%7Bh%7D%2Ci%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%5Cn%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D%7D_b%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BPRoPE%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Cwidehat%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D%7D_b%2Cp_b%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B14%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fda4279392852b925d8ad70fe8f647abf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aYQXo%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ua4852122"><li fid="u03546ee8" data-lake-id="u07e4052a" id="u07e4052a"><span data-lake-id="u99d6ae39" id="u99d6ae39">随后，通过满足块级因果约束的评分过程，得到块级重要性分数 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc3d09928a77aee0c25868ae2be611298.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qdpsH%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uebe359e2" id="uebe359e2">。对于查询词元 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2443fbcfeb7e85e1d62b6f5e4f27207e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cowjZ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0abcc71d" id="u0abcc71d"> 和压缩块 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22b%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd29c2e5f4926e5b0e9a95305650f6e54.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SMHK9%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u825f8a64" id="u825f8a64">，先对查询与键的相似度应用 ReLU，再对所有索引器头的结果求和</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u2f8adedc" id="u2f8adedc" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22I_%7Bib%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%5Cn%5C%5Csum_%7Bh%3D1%7D%5E%7BH%7D%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BReLU%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%5C%5Clangle%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_i%5E%7Bh%7D%2C%5Cn%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D%7D_b%5Cn%5C%5Cright%5C%5Crangle%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%2C%5Cn%26%5Cnp_b%2Br-1%5C%5Cleq%20i%2C%5Cn%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B6pt%5D%5Cn-%5C%5Cinfty%2C%5Cn%26%5Cn%5C%5Ctext%7Botherwise%7D.%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B15%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8c5ef08dfc2cd720e71ec63fd8cb8f4f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zPbBM%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u44dfb4e3"><li fid="u7db4cfb2" data-lake-id="u1fc12a13" id="u1fc12a13"><span data-lake-id="u12609549" id="u12609549">这一块级因果条件确保每个查询仅对已经完整观测到的块进行评分。给定词元预算 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38a3f4d664b7a723d138f9d57be0c783.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ARYX8%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u25d97026" id="u25d97026">，每个查询选择得分最高的压缩块。由于每个块包含 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F72cb3a229067770aeb6caa625a65a1a1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GcmBO%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub7ddc0fb" id="ub7ddc0fb"> 个词元，块数量预算为 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K_B%3D%5C%5Clceil%20K%2Fr%5C%5Crceil%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb6f2a7b72220ddf8c44c00a7e0ceee14.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LI6a0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u99ba04cf" id="u99ba04cf">​</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u228b9a7f" id="u228b9a7f" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BB%7D_i%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BTopK%7D_%7BK_B%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5C%7BI_%7Bib%7D%5C%5C%7D_b%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%5CnK_B%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%5C%5Clceil%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7BK%7D%7Br%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright%5C%5Crceil%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B16%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9354ec7ccd173bf27f0911b107c23f88.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22akor8%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u0b68a4f1"><li fid="uc48a4c9c" data-lake-id="u2d8d19b4" id="u2d8d19b4"><span data-lake-id="u404ab8f3" id="u404ab8f3">随后，将选中的块展开为原始词元索引，并截断至预算 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38a3f4d664b7a723d138f9d57be0c783.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22d0NcP%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud6f68679" id="ud6f68679">。这些词元与末尾不完整块中的词元共同构成核心注意力计算使用的最终集合；其中，末尾不完整块中的词元始终被纳入</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uab430b66" id="uab430b66"><strong><span data-lake-id="u20e4c52a" id="u20e4c52a" style="color: #5C0036">QSA 在 Qwen3.8-Flash-Next 的继续预训练阶段引入，训练序列长度为 256K 个词元。训练过程包括稠密蒸馏和稀疏训练两个阶段</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ud2113ddb" id="ud2113ddb"><strong><span data-lake-id="uece29394" id="uece29394">阶段一：稠密蒸馏。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u703cd6b5" id="u703cd6b5">首先，将主干网络在完整序列上的注意力分布蒸馏至索引器。词元级教师分布由所有教师注意力头的 softmax 注意力分布求和，再经 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8774782e75650651e5d3a5ded5c77e44.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FIYMd%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5c240cf6" id="u5c240cf6">归一化得到。记由此得到的查询 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2443fbcfeb7e85e1d62b6f5e4f27207e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dezYu%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u94498c7b" id="u94498c7b"> 指向词元 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22j%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F036441a335dd85c838f76d63a3db2363.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JM5ag%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u800bda50" id="u800bda50"> 的概率为 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22a_%7Bij%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffc79500df9b56f8f05f025e1a04b3131.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UxzXu%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7a2acf00" id="u7a2acf00">，完整的词元级分布为 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D_i%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bn%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48ea93f1ddc60156bdd74eb20bc06339.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zbdVG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u67acccaa" id="u67acccaa">。通过最大池化，将这一分布与块级索引器分数对齐，以保留可能在聚合过程中被稀释的重要词元级信号</span></p><p data-lake-id="ua203a4e9" id="ua203a4e9" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coverline%7Ba%7D_%7Bib%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BMaxPool%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D_%7Bi%2Cp_b%3Ap_b%2Br-1%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%5Cn%5C%5Cwidehat%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D%7D_i%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5Cn%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D%7D_i%5Cn%7D%7B%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7C%5Cn%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D%7D_i%5Cn%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C_1%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B17%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2d17167c635bf6c69fcd2c462598e639.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OWk50%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u7ec6d325"><li fid="u2e2d7184" data-lake-id="u77c09684" id="u77c09684"><span data-lake-id="u5fcc1705" id="u5fcc1705">令</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22B%3D%5C%5Clfloor%20n%2Fr%5C%5Crfloor%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F203bf61095bed09b91c5ac77f55daa9e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rqy5h%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6294bf1c" id="u6294bf1c">，则池化后的教师分布 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cwidehat%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D%7D_i%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BB%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0403949765a99357d122c11c4f75b9e8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22R8RTl%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u79ff5156" id="u79ff5156"> 与索引器分数 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D_i%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BB%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb34f2d8cccf7fb0d6973880f237e8394.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RM2k3%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u17d07b83" id="u17d07b83"> 具有相同的块维度。通过最小化以下目标，将归一化后的教师分数蒸馏至索引器</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u6ddfc00f" id="u6ddfc00f" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BN%7D%5Cn%5C%5Csum_i%5CnD_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Cwidehat%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D%7D_%7Bi%2C%3A%7D%5Cn%5C%5C%3B%5C%5Cmiddle%5C%5C%7C%5C%5C%3B%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BSoftmax%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D_%7Bi%2C%3A%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B18%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbffaa24d54fbb1f9de3b1256496247c1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IcSvP%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ue4e0ca6c"><li fid="ucf4eb132" data-lake-id="u2cbfd62b" id="u2cbfd62b"><span data-lake-id="u7a6e6343" id="u7a6e6343">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22N%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F459f3c80a50b7be28751b0869ef5386a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LxYZQ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u47e7c88c" id="u47e7c88c">为查询词元的数量。计算每个查询的 KL 损失时，仅纳入完整的键块。在预热阶段，仅训练索引器，共训练 1000 步，学习率为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%221%5C%5Ctimes10%5E%7B-3%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Faba967c9cc506d4674ccecf8c5cd86c8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SFKX2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua560ea35" id="ua560ea35">。每步包含 8 条长度为 256K 个词元的序列，训练词元总量约为 20 亿</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u58e29ed6" id="u58e29ed6"><strong><span data-lake-id="u571961e4" id="u571961e4">阶段二：稀疏训练。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub119ef41" id="ub119ef41">完成索引器初始化后，在索引器的引导下训练整个主干网络，使其适应稀疏注意力模式。QSA 首先选择得分最高的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K_B%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F333fd5d3011b77503b43fa8dcf52c535.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tm1VD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3417d459" id="u3417d459">个块，将这些块展开为词元索引，并与末尾不完整块中的尾部词元合并</span></p><p data-lake-id="u9bd656dc" id="u9bd656dc" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BS%7D_i%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BExpand%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Cmathcal%7BB%7D_i%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Ccup%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7B%5Cnr%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%5C%5Clfloor%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7Bi%2B1%7D%7Br%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright%5C%5Crfloor%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cldots%2C%5Cni%5Cn%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B19%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe637c3351f2dc78e39893e7688219123.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nYiXY%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u595df3c2"><li fid="u80d28d1c" data-lake-id="ud57cbbe8" id="ud57cbbe8"><span data-lake-id="u08f9e86d" id="u08f9e86d">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7BExpand%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F89e15f2ad9cb49a22c28d2f18bcc2f97.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VqhHO%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u33824910" id="u33824910">算子将选中的块映射为其对应的词元索引，所得集合</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BS%7D_i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbf62c6d02cdde4bf989f68a48dc7eac2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22x5SpN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1ef1ef41" id="u1ef1ef41">用于核心注意力计算。在这一阶段，索引器的 KL 损失仅在 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BB%7D_i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe21e3dff4da92cbd1193ab2d4f7c4e07.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22I0v3D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u85a84cad" id="u85a84cad"> 中得分最高的 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K_B%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F333fd5d3011b77503b43fa8dcf52c535.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UfXNV%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u352f4862" id="u352f4862"> 个块上计算。在计算 KL 散度之前，将教师分布在 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BB%7D_i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe21e3dff4da92cbd1193ab2d4f7c4e07.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NOYrF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u079b5705" id="u079b5705"> 内的概率重新归一化，使其总和为 1</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u4542795f" id="u4542795f" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BN%7D%5Cn%5C%5Csum_i%5CnD_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Cwidehat%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D%7D_%7Bi%2C%5C%5Cmathcal%7BB%7D_i%7D%5Cn%5C%5C%3B%5C%5Cmiddle%5C%5C%7C%5C%5C%3B%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BSoftmax%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D_%7Bi%2C%5C%5Cmathcal%7BB%7D_i%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B20%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc831f6eff857ead325ade2285536a3f6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DPc9k%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u7b577c0b"><li fid="uaae4a9cc" data-lake-id="u000b89df" id="u000b89df"><span data-lake-id="u3d0ae38b" id="u3d0ae38b">在 CPT 的最后阶段，启用 QSA，并以</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%222.5%5C%5Ctimes10%5E%7B-5%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9a3fdd4cf9fe664dba90e336ca4ebbc1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22z6mT7%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u53007284" id="u53007284">的学习率联合训练主干网络与索引器，共训练 8000 步。每步包含 96 条长度为 256K 个词元的序列，训练词元总量约为 2000 亿</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u6d4214be" id="u6d4214be"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6929c8d7" id="u6929c8d7">在 Qwen3.8-Flash-Next 中，主干网络和 MTP 模块内的所有全注意力层均被替换为 QSA，以提高长序列推理效率。压缩式轻量级索引器采用包含四个查询头和一个共享键头的 MQA 结构，并使用前述 partial RoPE 配置</span></strong></p><ul list="u1ff0b790"><li fid="uc0f9b4ad" data-lake-id="ua1f97fb7" id="ua1f97fb7"><span data-lake-id="u187dbb9d" id="u187dbb9d">当词元预算为 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%3D2048%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff6fe8e84d3def2eb50bf6e7aa7ddd51d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hMwQY%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u10faa28e" id="u10faa28e">、压缩比为 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r%3D4%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0e3ef217807022315e8212595fe4a1ae.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bYuLH%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0e234bcc" id="u0e234bcc"> 时，QSA 为每个查询最多选择 512 个完整块，并额外纳入末尾不完整块中的尾部词元。索引器对重要性的准确估计，使模型在第二阶段的稀疏训练中能够紧密跟随全注意力模型的语言模型损失变化轨迹</span></li><li fid="uc0f9b4ad" data-lake-id="uda8691a5" id="uda8691a5"><span data-lake-id="u489678ec" id="u489678ec">为提高训练效率，实现融合式 QSA 计算核，在联合计算稀疏注意力输出与 KL 损失时，无需显式存储中间结果，从而显著降低内存占用。压缩索引器在压缩后的序列上进行评分，同时减少索引器计算与 top-</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mxBj4%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2837bcdc" id="u2837bcdc"> 选择的开销。此外，多步 MTP 在不同预测步骤之间复用 top-</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Hjikm%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7122635d" id="u7122635d"> 索引，以进一步降低草稿模型的推理成本</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf187570d" id="uf187570d" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1793495336443-38c03de0-e319-44f4-bb98-9893ed8cbc4d.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u49f728fc-2586-45fc-af6a-ac5e896a508%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22uf12b7185-b01f-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A885.6000366210938%2C%22height%22%3A123%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A52754%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1157%2C%22originHeight%22%3A161%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22SUPERGPQA%22%2C%22x%22%3A237%2C%22y%22%3A60%2C%22width%22%3A147%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MMLU-PRO%22%2C%22x%22%3A130%2C%22y%22%3A59%2C%22width%22%3A126%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MULTIPL-E%22%2C%22x%22%3A948%2C%22y%22%3A58%2C%22width%22%3A126%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MIMMLU%22%2C%22x%22%3A731%2C%22y%22%3A57%2C%22width%22%3A101%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GSM8K%22%2C%22x%22%3A480%2C%22y%22%3A58%2C%22width%22%3A93%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MULTILINGUAL%22%2C%22x%22%3A713%2C%22y%22%3A26%2C%22width%22%3A124%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EVALPLUS%22%2C%22x%22%3A864%2C%22y%22%3A59%2C%22width%22%3A96%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FULATTN%22%2C%22x%22%3A20%2C%22y%22%3A96%2C%22width%22%3A81%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MATH%22%2C%22x%22%3A404%2C%22y%22%3A58%2C%22width%22%3A80%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22KNOWLEDGE%22%2C%22x%22%3A198%2C%22y%22%3A28%2C%22width%22%3A110%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22REASONING%22%2C%22x%22%3A600%2C%22y%22%3A28%2C%22width%22%3A104%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22METHOD%22%2C%22x%22%3A25%2C%22y%22%3A62%2C%22width%22%3A76%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2279.8%22%2C%22x%22%3A1002%2C%22y%22%3A115%2C%22width%22%3A45%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2291.0%22%2C%22x%22%3A507%2C%22y%22%3A96%2C%22width%22%3A51%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2290.4%22%2C%22x%22%3A624%2C%22y%22%3A96%2C%22width%22%3A45%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2251.7%22%2C%22x%22%3A292%2C%22y%22%3A95%2C%22width%22%3A50%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22W%2FQSA%22%2C%22x%22%3A21%2C%22y%22%3A121%2C%22width%22%3A80%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2272.9%22%2C%22x%22%3A159%2C%22y%22%3A96%2C%22width%22%3A45%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2272.3%22%2C%22x%22%3A885%2C%22y%22%3A114%2C%22width%22%3A44%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2281.1%22%2C%22x%22%3A756%2C%22y%22%3A113%2C%22width%22%3A46%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2271.6%22%2C%22x%22%3A416%2C%22y%22%3A116%2C%22width%22%3A44%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2292.2%22%2C%22x%22%3A511%2C%22y%22%3A116%2C%22width%22%3A45%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2269.8%22%2C%22x%22%3A416%2C%22y%22%3A97%2C%22width%22%3A43%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2291.6%22%2C%22x%22%3A623%2C%22y%22%3A116%2C%22width%22%3A48%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BBH%22%2C%22x%22%3A617%2C%22y%22%3A57%2C%22width%22%3A56%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2278.4%22%2C%22x%22%3A999%2C%22y%22%3A95%2C%22width%22%3A52%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2252.1%22%2C%22x%22%3A298%2C%22y%22%3A115%2C%22width%22%3A41%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CODE%22%2C%22x%22%3A934%2C%22y%22%3A27%2C%22width%22%3A61%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2275.9%22%2C%22x%22%3A1098%2C%22y%22%3A96%2C%22width%22%3A44%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22STEM%22%2C%22x%22%3A456%2C%22y%22%3A26%2C%22width%22%3A63%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2273.7%22%2C%22x%22%3A159%2C%22y%22%3A114%2C%22width%22%3A42%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2270.8%22%2C%22x%22%3A883%2C%22y%22%3A96%2C%22width%22%3A47%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2276.8%22%2C%22x%22%3A1098%2C%22y%22%3A117%2C%22width%22%3A42%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22AVG%22%2C%22x%22%3A1100%2C%22y%22%3A63%2C%22width%22%3A44%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2281.8%22%2C%22x%22%3A754%2C%22y%22%3A96%2C%22width%22%3A49%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f1f0ef%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u2221532a%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ubc436707" id="ubc436707"><strong><span data-lake-id="u196f3ef5" id="u196f3ef5">性能评估：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u00c029b7" id="u00c029b7">QSA 在 8 项通用基准中的 7 项上达到或超过全注意力基线，平均得分由 75.9 提升至 76.8。其长上下文检索优势在较长序列上更为明显：超过 512K 时，RULER 得分由 90.08 提升至 93.00；在 512K 和 1M 长度下，MRCR 得分分别由 30.66、20.71 提升至 40.53、26.44。此外，在四步投机解码中，跨步骤复用 QSA 索引后，MTP 的平均接受长度未出现显著变化</span></p><p data-lake-id="uf4158923" id="uf4158923"><strong><span data-lake-id="u76ac38f7" id="u76ac38f7">效率与加速：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u1d716cf9" id="u1d716cf9">QSA 通过将键序列压缩至原长度的 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%221%2Fr%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F855c77fd4ae24ca6a3d5dfdd89de1aee.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VlwWm%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucf601c65" id="ucf601c65">，将索引器复杂度由 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O(n%5E2)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff2d5f588234eb61a559ff90c41511b85.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Xa9Jj%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u02028699" id="u02028699"> 降至 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O(n%5E2%2Fr)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8349978a8481c5fa82fe52f9e123c6d5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KWyTA%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf640aab1" id="uf640aab1">，同时减少 MQA logits 计算与 top-</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MoXYk%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u127dc749" id="u127dc749"> 选择的开销。在同时计入索引器和稀疏核心注意力计算的计算核测试中，相较于 FlashInfer 的分页 GQA 基线，QSA 在 1M 上下文长度下的预填充与解码注意力模块加速比分别达到 7.6 倍和 4.9 倍</span></p><p data-lake-id="u5daa8127" id="u5daa8127"><strong><span data-lake-id="u11ba0dcb" id="u11ba0dcb">架构消融：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u7b9ee8e4" id="u7b9ee8e4">在 35B-A3B 模型上的实验表明，QSA 在相对索引延迟降至 0.25 时即可达到全注意力基线的性能，而跨层共享索引的 IndexShare 在相对延迟为 0.5 时仍低于基线，支持混合架构中采用层内压缩的设计。训练方式同样重要：稠密蒸馏后直接启用稀疏注意力会导致性能下降，经过短期联合训练后则可恢复至全注意力水平。查询头数量消融进一步表明，少量索引器查询头即可维持性能；综合推理速度与准确率，最终采用四个查询头</span></p>